        "locator": "pfr-torsion",
        "text": "\\begin{theorem}[PFR]\\label{pfr-torsion}\\lean{torsion_PFR}\\leanok  Suppose that $G$ is a finite abelian group of torsion $m$.\n  If $A \\subset G$ is non-empty and $|A+A| \\leq K|A|$, then $A$ can be covered by at most $mK^{256m^3+1}$ translates of a subspace $H$ of $G$ with $|H| \\leq |A|$.\n  \\end{theorem}",
        "selected": true
      }
